# Content paths for repo-lint tooling routing (#2921).
#
# One case glob per line: a plain relative path, or a directory followed by
# `/*` (which matches everything beneath it). A pull request whose every
# changed path matches a line here, and none matches the tooling globs that
# scripts/ci/repo-lint-tooling-scope.sh hard-codes, skips the lint-fast
# tooling-only checks. Anything else runs the full set.
#
# This file is per repo and is never propagated. List only paths that no
# scripts/ci check reads; editing this file is itself a tooling change.
plans/*
bugs/*
docs/audits/*
docs/retrospectives/*
